          "kicker": "Deaf Rugby Sevens",
          "heading": "Fiji's deaf national rugby sevens teams face $70,000 funding shortfall",
          "body": "Fiji’s men’s and women’s deaf national rugby sevens teams are scrambling to raise up to $70,000 to secure their travel to the World Deaf Rugby Sevens Championship in Tokyo. Despite receiving grants from the Fiji National Sports Commission and the Australian High Commission’s PacificAus Sports programme, team manager Lionel Danford confirmed a significant financial deficit remains. Players, many of whom are currently unemployed, have been covering their own training travel expenses. The squad recently entered camp in Sigatoka ahead of the tournament, which starts later this month."
